Deception-Driven Financial Fraud
Scenario
The customer was approached with a purported high-return financial opportunity through a trusted source.
To create a sense of exclusivity and urgency, the fraudster instructed the customer to keep the transactions strictly confidential, including from bank staff.
Believing the opportunity was genuine and time-sensitive, the customer visited the branch and executed the transfers as instructed.
Transaction Summary
Total amount transferred: SAR 455,000
Transactions executed through the branch.
3 transactions were processed: 1 internal transfer and 2 RTGS transfers.
